Dialogue: 10,0:04:35.04,0:04:36.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Opa, Coordenadora!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:37.67,0:04:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Hã? Ela não está?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:40.75,0:04:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Inspire bem fundo.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:43.47,0:04:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,E solte. Agora, respire bem fundo.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:47.47,0:04:51.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Inspire. E respire.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:52.73,0:04:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Pois bem...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:54.89,0:04:58.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu agora vou tocar a sua Soul Gem.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:03.11,0:05:04.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Acho que ela está com uma cliente.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:06.24,0:05:07.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Numa hora destas?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:19.34,0:05:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Desculpem.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:20.75,0:05:22.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Ela apareceu do nada.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:23.01,0:05:28.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Enfim, vocês novamente trouxeram uma novata para mim hoje, então?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:34.14,0:05:35.85,Default,,0,0,0,,E-Eu sou Tamaki Iroha.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:35.85,0:05:38.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu sou Yakumo Mitama, a Coordenadora.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:39.31,0:05:41.15,Default,,0,0,0,,É a sua primeira vez sendo ajustada?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:41.61,0:05:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Ela não veio ser ajustada. Cadê a Yachiyo-san?
Dialogue: 3,0:05:41.61,0:05:45.24,NSigns,,0,0,0,,{\pos(994,895)\fnCheyenne Hand Bold\b1\fs44\fsp1\blur0.7\c&HC55BA1&\frz238}Fora
